---
layout: layouts/base.njk
bodyClass: page-home
---
{% from "partials/macros.njk" import logo, cover, polaroids, signup, video, subscribe with context %}
{% set bookOne = books.bookOne %}
{% set xavierTwo = (books.sides | byLine("xavier"))[0] %}
{% set marcusTwo = (books.sides | byLine("marcus"))[0] %}
{% set latestVideos = youtube.latest.slice(0, 3) %}
{% set latestPosts = collections.journal.slice(0, 3) %}

{#- Tamica first: who she is and her introduction video, then her story, Letters, what's new,
    and only then the books. #}
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero__grid hero__grid--intro">
    <div class="hero__text">
      <p class="eyebrow">{{ site.brand }}</p>
      <h1 class="hero__hello">Hi, I’m Tamica.</h1>
      <p class="lede">A thyroid cancer survivor, a proud military spouse and an empty nester, rediscovering myself through style, travel and storytelling.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="#letters">Join Letters</a>
        {{ subscribe("btn--ghost") }}
      </div>
      <p class="hero__note"><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Writing <a href="/books/">SEASONS</a>, a novel series inspired by my life.</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero__media">
      {%- if youtube.featured %}
      {{ video(youtube.featured, "video--feature") }}
      <p class="video-note">Videos play from YouTube when you press play.</p>
      {%- else %}
      <div class="video video--feature video--soon">
        <img src="/assets/img/tamica-luxembourg-1200.jpg" width="1200" height="1600" alt="Tamica smiling, seated on a stone wall above a green valley in Luxembourg">
        <span class="video__soon">My introduction, coming soon</span>
      </div>
      {%- endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--paper" aria-labelledby="my-story">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section__head">
      <p class="eyebrow">My story</p>
      <h2 id="my-story">Three big changes, all at once</h2>
      <p>Cancer, military life far from home, and an empty nest brought me to a crossroads. Here’s what came of it.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="perks">
      <li><span class="perks__num">One</span><h3>Survivor</h3><p>I faced thyroid cancer and came through it. Healing changed how I want to live every season that comes next.</p></li>
      <li><span class="perks__num">Two</span><h3>Military spouse</h3><p>Moves, waiting, homecomings and the life in between. Europe became more than a duty station: a place to heal and create.</p></li>
      <li><span class="perks__num">Three</span><h3>Reinvention</h3><p>With the kids grown, I’m rediscovering myself through style, travel and storytelling, and sharing it all here.</p></li>
    </ul>
    <div class="name-story name-story--home">
      {{ logo("name-story__logo", "color", "SHE FLUTTER logo: a butterfly with the words SHE FLUTTER inside") }}
      <div>
        <h3>Why SHE FLUTTER?</h3>
        <p>The name honors the flutter of uncertainty that comes with change, and the strength it takes to rise anyway. It’s about movement, grace, and the quiet power of reinvention.</p>
        <p><a class="text-link" href="/her-story/">Read my story</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="letters" class="section section--plum signup-band" aria-labelledby="letters-title">
  <div class="wrap signup-band__grid">
    <div class="signup-band__art flutter">{{ logo("", "white") }}</div>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">Letters</p>
      <h2 id="letters-title">Letters from <em>Tamica</em></h2>
      <p>Every other week: a real moment from my life, the places behind the stories, and the first look at what I’m writing. When <em>SEASONS</em> Book One is ready in early 2027, Letters readers get it free.</p>
      {{ signup("home", "Join Letters", true) }}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{%- if latestVideos.length or latestPosts.length %}
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="latest">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section__head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Latest</p>
      <h2 id="latest">New from my world</h2>
    </div>
    {%- if latestVideos.length %}
    <ul class="videos">
      {%- for v in latestVideos %}
      <li class="video-card">
        {{ video(v) }}
        <h3 class="video-card__title">{{ v.title }}</h3>
        <p class="video-card__meta">{% if v.short %}Short · {% endif %}{{ v.published | readableDate }}</p>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    {%- endif %}
    {%- if latestPosts.length %}
    <ul class="posts{% if latestVideos.length %} posts--after{% endif %}">
      {%- for post in latestPosts %}
      <li class="post-card">
        <a href="{{ post.url }}">
          {%- if post.data.image %}
          <img src="{{ post.data.image }}" alt="{{ post.data.imageAlt or '' }}" loading="lazy">
          {%- endif %}
          <p class="post-card__meta"><time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time></p>
          <h2>{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
          {%- if post.data.summary %}<p>{{ post.data.summary }}</p>{% endif %}
        </a>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    {%- endif %}
    <div class="actions actions--center">
      {%- if latestVideos.length %}<a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/watch/">More videos</a>{% endif %}
      {%- if latestPosts.length %}<a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/journal/">The journal</a>{% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif %}

<section class="section places-band" aria-labelledby="places">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section__head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Where life has taken me</p>
      <h2 id="places">Across the USA and Europe</h2>
      <p>From Rodeo Drive to a balcony at Versailles. Germany is home for now.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  {{ polaroids(places.home) }}
</section>

<section class="section section--paper" aria-labelledby="writing">
  <div class="wrap hero__grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">What I’m writing</p>
      <h2 id="writing" class="writing__title">SEASONS</h2>
      <p class="hero__tagline">{{ site.tagline }}</p>
      <p>A novel series inspired by my life. It follows Imani, a girl raised in the furnace, as she learns to stop bracing, to be loved without being hurt, and to raise children who never have to hold their breath. After Book One, her story splits into two lives, and every book after it carries both.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/books/">Meet the books</a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/books/{{ bookOne.slug }}/">Book One</a>
      </div>
      <p class="hero__note"><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>{{ site.bookOneStatus }}: <em>Book One, Summer 2002</em></p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero__art hero__art--plain">
      <a class="hero__cover hero__cover--x" href="/books/">{{ cover(xavierTwo) }}</a>
      <a class="hero__cover hero__cover--m" href="/books/">{{ cover(marcusTwo) }}</a>
      <a class="hero__cover hero__cover--front" href="/books/{{ bookOne.slug }}/">{{ cover(bookOne) }}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="follow">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section__head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Follow along</p>
      <h2 id="follow">Style, travel and the story behind the story</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="follow">
      {%- for s in site.social %}
      <a class="follow__card" href="{{ s.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <span class="follow__name">{{ s.name }}</span>
        <span class="follow__handle">{{ s.handle }}</span>
      </a>
      {%- endfor %}
      <a class="follow__card" href="/journal/">
        <span class="follow__name">Journal</span>
        <span class="follow__handle">Notes from Europe and beyond</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
